// Title: Registry Modification Via Regini.EXE
// Rule ID: 5f60740a-f57b-4e76-82a1-15b6ff2cb134
// Severity: low
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.t1112, attack.defense-evasion
// Category: process_creation
